// Sheet: "corrosive+chilling void zone, blinded inside the sphere, slowed
// exit" -- a genuine dual-rider persistent zone (damage AND a control
// debuff at once), unlike the Wave-1 zone spells (entangle.ron/fog_cloud.ron/
// grease.ron), which were each single-rider (entangle: restrain only,
// fog_cloud: blind only, grease: terrain only). `StaticAura`'s `auras:`
// accepts multiple entries
// simultaneously (see web.ron in this same batch), so both riders ship
// together: `Bleeding` for the periodic acid/cold damage (same
// generic-DoT-buff choice as cloud_of_daggers.ron -- no acid- or
// cold-specific DoT `BuffKind` exists, `Burning` is fire-specific and
// grants Frozen-immunity, a flavor mismatch worse than Bleeding's plain
// physical framing) and `Blinded` at the exact same strength fog_cloud.ron
// already ships (0.4), matching "grope blindly through the smothering
// dark" directly. The sheet's secondary "slowed exit" (creatures take extra
// damage trying to leave) has no distinct primitive beyond what's already
// modeled and is dropped. `StaticAura` always places the zone at the
// caster's own position -- the sheet's 46 m cast range isn't mechanically
// expressed, same simplification as entangle/fog_cloud/grease.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.7,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.45,
    energy_cost: 85.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Bleeding, strength: 6.0, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
        (kind: Blinded, strength: 0.4, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(25.0),
    range: 6.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
